# Machine-local and agent-written state under .claude/. The rest of this
# directory is TRACKED on purpose: an agent, skill or rule inside an ignored
# directory never reaches a clone, which is not a stricter form of sharing it.
#
# The root .gitignore carries the same entries, as house policy requires of
# every repository. This copy keeps the list beside the directory it governs,
# and for paths under .claude/ its patterns take precedence over the root's.
settings.local.json
worktrees/
agent-memory-local/
launch.json
scheduled_tasks.json
**/*.local.*
**/*-local/
